<title>GERMANY: Germany's AMV sees profits rise in 1997.</title>
<headline>Germany's AMV sees profits rise in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>COLOGNE, Germany 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>German insurer Aachener und Muenchener Versicherung AG  AMV said on Wednesday it expected higher profits in 1997.</p>
<p>It said earlier that it expected 1997 profits to be sufficient to allow an unchanged dividend pay-out this year.</p>
<p>Management board chairman Elmo Freiherr von Schorlemer told a news briefing later that profits had to increase if dividends were to be maintained and reserves strengthened.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
